Package: SampleAnnotationLikelihood
Title: Dataset-Specific RNA-Seq Sample Annotation Quality Control
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("MISID_QC", "contributors", email = "83993257+DaliaMz@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Scores repeated-measures RNA-seq samples against candidate
    individual identities using shrinkage linear discriminant analysis,
    performs within-dataset validation, and reports dataset-specific
    feasibility warnings.
